      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `76f5c3e1349f02faf5f43db110f5af79a38ea55721310812bcd3c6907e0497db--6.-Family-and-domestic-violence-experimental-data.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2019-20\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 12 of 12\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 5d4433b9ad7881a731c20b9d3125a1d707b3bf7f95af28fb02ed9dddc020f73a | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | fc8f9c8750debb5e7192fb134547900d835464b94c4304f292ab7a1977f3056e | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 0ec25f6706a7d52d54b6fcdaaa88af022142554e7aa1c8f9ecf89a99275b1aaf | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 8945e0a5155f3aaca18f8fec04b2f6f5fdd0a3825a46a98ec8db03f080d1981d | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 287e3cce6c97731e02f8099b4c91b281ea3875b6d46fec10f6fd0ab02d4994ff | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | aa51e77026e6b5f7fa3a022afa67537ea2017adee9be2304236743863950f71f | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | bc2e421ae8b3a22445ad8f7c84ce43ad3fc5f211b5c01343cc1954a43ee9d4f0 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | f674c1e2baae795b9b184760b713db5f11e522ae8bf5f689f766a6857e5e1922 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 18bca4244457c67069bd69a867c06366dae5cd49bdb2070480d1a1015052468a | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | 084f777df326038fa5605a95db6573ee957233ec6a70c266a32a81fdf130d202 | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | 8e22fbc0fa5159d13a3d15d98ac37e2830b3f7f7b1ff101ea35cfd96112d02d7 | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | d64e1d157588ed05373a5cb3c09be96640fd2813b012b5b6b7fcac9e2fb9682a | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `n